<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE- AXXICON POSTS FIRST-HALF LOSS.</title>
<headline>TABLE- AXXICON POSTS FIRST-HALF LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First 24 weeks of 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Loss per share (guilders)	  0.13 vs   1.37 profit</p>
<p>    Net loss				 0.3  vs   3.0 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover				41.0  vs  44.2</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.3  vs   5.0</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.8  vs   0.5</p>
<p>    Tax gain				 0.2  vs   1.5 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial moulds maker Axxicon Group NV previously</p>
<p>posted a first-quarter profit of 0.5 million guilders, down from</p>
<p>1.6 million in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
